This project is a non-commercial public interest cultural preservation initiative 
(见素文献保护计划 · 非商业公益数字化抢救工程).

You are free to:
- Share — copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format
- Adapt — remix, transform, and build upon the material

Under the following terms:
- Attribution — You must give appropriate credit, provide a link to the license, 
  and indicate if changes were made.
- NonCommercial — You may NOT use the material for commercial purposes or publication profits.

Respect of Original Authors:
All original texts, architectural photographs, and forum discussions belong to their 
respective original authors from the 2000–2010 ABBS Forum threads (逸风, cimo, 樟木, 心在门外, etc.).
